@withoutSpaces
SAFE_PIANO_RH_VARIATIONS_32 → SAFE_PIANO_RH_THEME_8 SAFE_PIANO_RH_RHYTHM_8 SAFE_PIANO_RH_REGISTER_8 SAFE_PIANO_RH_CODA_8
